<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://purl.org/linked-data/sdmx/2009/measure#obsValue> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/doi> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
